1
00:01:42,740 --> 00:01:47,970
[When I Meet The Moon]

2
00:01:48,080 --> 00:01:51,080
[Episode 1]

3
00:01:57,380 --> 00:01:58,780
[Domestic Security Check]

4
00:02:04,120 --> 00:02:05,210
Sorry, the subscriber

5
00:02:05,210 --> 00:02:06,370
you dialed

6
00:02:06,370 --> 00:02:08,370
cannot be connected for the moment.

7
00:02:09,710 --> 00:02:10,410
Miss. Miss.

8
00:02:10,710 --> 00:02:12,240
We're just one person short.

9
00:02:12,240 --> 00:02:12,740
We'll get there right on time.

10
00:02:12,740 --> 00:02:13,130
No, thanks.

11
00:02:13,130 --> 00:02:13,580
We'll be there in 20 minutes, I promise.

12
00:02:13,580 --> 00:02:14,410
No, thank you.

13
00:02:14,500 --> 00:02:14,910
Miss,

14
00:02:14,910 --> 00:02:15,690
you're from out of town, right?

15
00:02:15,690 --> 00:02:16,900
I see you've been standing there for ages.

16
00:02:16,900 --> 00:02:17,360
Don't have a place to stay?

17
00:02:17,360 --> 00:02:18,000
Come stay at our inn.

18
00:02:18,000 --> 00:02:18,590
No need, someone's picking me up.

19
00:02:18,590 --> 00:02:19,620
Our inn is just nearby.

20
00:02:19,620 --> 00:02:20,310
I'm not here for traveling.

21
00:02:20,310 --> 00:02:20,650
Miss.

22
00:02:20,650 --> 00:02:21,300
It's cheap and clean.

23
00:02:21,300 --> 00:02:22,060
We got all good reviews.

24
00:02:22,060 --> 00:02:23,460
I'll give you a discount!

25
00:02:25,800 --> 00:02:26,860
It's been an hour.

26
00:02:26,860 --> 00:02:28,790
Why isn't she answering the phone?

27
00:02:29,720 --> 00:02:30,370
Miss He.

28
00:02:30,400 --> 00:02:31,150
I've been at the airport

29
00:02:31,150 --> 00:02:32,150
for an hour now,

30
00:02:32,150 --> 00:02:33,590
but I haven't been able to reach you.

31
00:02:33,590 --> 00:02:34,810
I'm not sure what's going on.

32
00:02:34,810 --> 00:02:35,840
It's getting late.

33
00:02:35,840 --> 00:02:37,530
Please send someone to pick me up
as soon as possible.

34
00:02:37,530 --> 00:02:38,150
Thank you.

35
00:02:39,000 --> 00:02:40,710
Does it sound a bit too harsh?

36
00:02:47,860 --> 00:02:49,470
Hello, Miss He.

37
00:02:49,579 --> 00:02:50,310
Sorry to bother you.

38
00:02:50,310 --> 00:02:51,410
May I ask...

39
00:02:53,240 --> 00:02:53,870
You...

40
00:02:56,030 --> 00:02:56,430
Hi.

41
00:02:56,810 --> 00:02:57,560
Excuse me.

42
00:02:57,560 --> 00:02:58,410
Are you here on vacation?

43
00:02:58,410 --> 00:02:58,800
No need.

44
00:02:58,800 --> 00:03:00,330
I'm not looking for a hotel.

45
00:03:00,560 --> 00:03:01,360
No, no. I just wanted

46
00:03:01,360 --> 00:03:03,120
to add you on WeChat.

47
00:03:04,120 --> 00:03:04,860
Don't worry,

48
00:03:04,860 --> 00:03:05,900
I'm not a bad person,

49
00:03:05,900 --> 00:03:08,090
and I'm not trying to lure you into
staying at my hotel or anything.

50
00:03:08,090 --> 00:03:09,950
I just want to be friends with you.

51
00:03:11,400 --> 00:03:12,410
You're a student, right?

52
00:03:12,410 --> 00:03:13,470
I'm a student, too.

53
00:03:15,360 --> 00:03:16,360
Don't believe me?

54
00:03:16,460 --> 00:03:16,900
I can show you

55
00:03:16,900 --> 00:03:17,520
my student ID.

56
00:03:17,520 --> 00:03:18,620
No, no. No need.

57
00:03:18,620 --> 00:03:19,360
No need.

58
00:03:20,190 --> 00:03:21,000
Then,

59
00:03:21,880 --> 00:03:22,720
let me add you on WeChat first.

60
00:03:22,720 --> 00:03:23,520
I'll scan you.

61
00:03:23,810 --> 00:03:24,620
Come on.

62
00:03:28,650 --> 00:03:29,460
Accept it.

63
00:03:36,060 --> 00:03:38,590
Steal A Moment... To Sip Wine...
Guesthouse?

64
00:03:39,880 --> 00:03:41,140
That's not important.

65
00:03:41,530 --> 00:03:42,130
Are you

66
00:03:42,130 --> 00:03:43,079
going to EAW?

67
00:03:44,710 --> 00:03:45,810
How do you know?

68
00:03:47,030 --> 00:03:47,620
Sorry.

69
00:03:47,620 --> 00:03:49,470
When I was adding you,

70
00:03:49,470 --> 00:03:50,530
I accidentally saw it.

71
00:03:50,530 --> 00:03:51,460
I didn't mean it.

72
00:03:53,340 --> 00:03:54,130
Well,

73
00:03:54,520 --> 00:03:56,280
aren't you here a bit too early?

74
00:03:57,190 --> 00:03:57,900
EAW

75
00:03:57,900 --> 00:03:59,680
won't open until the end of the month.

76
00:03:59,680 --> 00:04:00,910
I was invited here.

77
00:04:01,410 --> 00:04:02,130
Invited?

78
00:04:02,810 --> 00:04:03,150
So you're

79
00:04:03,150 --> 00:04:04,520
one of the invited content creators,
right?

80
00:04:04,520 --> 00:04:05,030
Yes.

81
00:04:06,750 --> 00:04:08,680
Come with me. It's on my way anyway.

82
00:04:10,410 --> 00:04:11,470
Speaking of which,

83
00:04:11,860 --> 00:04:12,810
EAW

84
00:04:13,410 --> 00:04:15,470
actually has something to do with me.

85
00:04:15,810 --> 00:04:16,620
EAW—

86
00:04:17,180 --> 00:04:18,240
my brother owns it.

87
00:04:19,130 --> 00:04:20,540
What is he trying to do?

88
00:04:21,070 --> 00:04:23,220
Why doesn't he just brag
that he owns it himself?

89
00:04:23,220 --> 00:04:24,480
It's too much trouble.

90
00:04:24,510 --> 00:04:25,560
I'll go...

91
00:04:25,560 --> 00:04:26,310
I'll go that way.

92
00:04:26,310 --> 00:04:27,180
I... I'm leaving now.

93
00:04:27,180 --> 00:04:27,860
Bye-bye.

94
00:04:28,560 --> 00:04:29,890
It's really no trouble.

95
00:04:35,370 --> 00:04:36,240
Sure, sure.

96
00:04:40,570 --> 00:04:41,630
Hello, Miss He.

97
00:04:41,630 --> 00:04:43,100
Ms. Idle Cloud, I'm so sorry.

98
00:04:43,100 --> 00:04:44,600
I accidentally fell asleep

99
00:04:44,600 --> 00:04:45,930
and didn't notice
that the driver had canceled

100
00:04:45,930 --> 00:04:47,100
my airport pickup at the last minute.

101
00:04:47,100 --> 00:04:47,870
I-It's okay.

102
00:04:47,870 --> 00:04:50,540
I... I only just arrived not long ago.

103
00:04:50,890 --> 00:04:52,040
I've already contacted someone else

104
00:04:52,040 --> 00:04:52,950
to come pick you up.

105
00:04:52,950 --> 00:04:54,540
I've sent the license plate number
to your phone.

106
00:04:54,540 --> 00:04:55,470
I-It's alright.

107
00:04:55,630 --> 00:04:56,630
See you tomorrow.

108
00:04:56,680 --> 00:04:57,630
See you tomorrow.

109
00:04:57,630 --> 00:04:58,570
Okay, bye-bye.

110
00:05:06,040 --> 00:05:08,170
That must've been the driver calling.

111
00:05:15,830 --> 00:05:16,770
Hello?

112
00:05:17,700 --> 00:05:18,570
Sorry.

113
00:05:18,570 --> 00:05:19,900
I accidentally hung up.

114
00:05:19,930 --> 00:05:20,680
Are you

115
00:05:20,680 --> 00:05:21,830
from EAW?

116
00:05:22,830 --> 00:05:24,360
Come out, cross the street,

117
00:05:25,270 --> 00:05:26,870
and you'll see a parking lot.

118
00:05:27,750 --> 00:05:28,630
I... Alright, I'll

119
00:05:28,630 --> 00:05:30,030
come out and find you now.

120
00:05:30,620 --> 00:05:31,680
Did you bring an umbrella?

121
00:05:31,680 --> 00:05:32,470
I did.

122
00:05:33,310 --> 00:05:35,280
I'll wait for you in the parking lot.

123
00:05:35,280 --> 00:05:35,820
Okay.

124
00:05:35,850 --> 00:05:36,980
I'll be right there.

125
00:06:14,510 --> 00:06:15,130
Hello.

126
00:06:15,130 --> 00:06:16,010
Are you the driver

127
00:06:16,010 --> 00:06:16,810
from EAW?

128
00:06:18,100 --> 00:06:19,940
Could you open the trunk, please?

129
00:06:19,940 --> 00:06:20,710
Thank you.

130
00:06:43,790 --> 00:06:45,390
It's okay. I can do it myself.

131
00:06:45,890 --> 00:06:47,120
Thank you.

132
00:06:55,130 --> 00:06:55,680
No need.

133
00:07:28,920 --> 00:07:30,580
There are tissues down there.

134
00:07:31,860 --> 00:07:32,650
Thank you.

135
00:07:40,740 --> 00:07:42,270
S-Sorry

136
00:07:42,360 --> 00:07:43,060
for troubling you

137
00:07:43,060 --> 00:07:44,920
to come pick me up so late at night.

138
00:07:47,950 --> 00:07:48,600
Where to?

139
00:07:50,690 --> 00:07:51,860
Yangjin Hotel.

140
00:07:51,950 --> 00:07:52,750
Thank you.

141
00:08:14,800 --> 00:08:16,720
About how long will it take?

142
00:08:17,130 --> 00:08:17,960
30 minutes.

143
00:08:20,060 --> 00:08:20,860
Okay.

144
00:08:30,000 --> 00:08:32,460
Why are we taking such a remote route?

145
00:08:43,679 --> 00:08:45,910
I've already transferred the money to you.

146
00:08:45,910 --> 00:08:46,770
Cut the crap.

147
00:08:47,150 --> 00:08:47,960
Money?

148
00:08:48,080 --> 00:08:48,870
What money?

149
00:08:49,340 --> 00:08:51,750
I hope he hasn't sold me already.

150
00:09:05,720 --> 00:09:06,980
Why is he looking at me?

151
00:09:07,550 --> 00:09:08,390
Help.

152
00:09:08,390 --> 00:09:09,940
Where is this?

153
00:09:14,980 --> 00:09:16,580
The highway is under repair.

154
00:09:16,860 --> 00:09:18,060
This route is faster.

155
00:09:19,890 --> 00:09:21,150
I... I'm not in a hurry.

156
00:09:21,500 --> 00:09:22,290
Not at all.

157
00:09:51,360 --> 00:09:52,150
Thank you.

158
00:09:52,720 --> 00:09:53,860
I can do it myself.

159
00:10:04,320 --> 00:10:05,250
W-Wait a minute.

160
00:10:09,960 --> 00:10:12,180
The rain probably won't stop
any time soon.

161
00:10:12,180 --> 00:10:13,170
I'll be stopping by

162
00:10:13,170 --> 00:10:14,060
EAW tomorrow.

163
00:10:14,130 --> 00:10:16,260
You can just leave it at the front desk.

164
00:11:07,400 --> 00:11:10,210
♪ I look up at the sky ♪

165
00:11:11,080 --> 00:11:13,730
♪ And there you are, always by my side ♪

166
00:11:14,420 --> 00:11:16,830
♪ Since when did it begin? ♪

167
00:11:16,850 --> 00:11:20,050
♪ I can't quite recall ♪

168
00:11:20,960 --> 00:11:24,050
♪ You became the clouds in my dreams ♪

169
00:11:24,540 --> 00:11:26,700
♪ Silent and weightless ♪

170
00:11:26,970 --> 00:11:30,010
♪ I wish I could stay ♪

171
00:11:27,860 --> 00:11:30,120
We've arrived at
Xifu Experimental Middle School.

172
00:11:30,120 --> 00:11:31,290
Passengers getting off,

173
00:11:30,710 --> 00:11:34,010
♪ Walking by your side forever ♪

174
00:11:31,290 --> 00:11:33,220
please exit through the rear door.

175
00:11:35,580 --> 00:11:38,510
♪ Through seasons of endless change ♪

176
00:11:38,530 --> 00:11:40,690
♪ Through tides that ebb and flow ♪

177
00:11:42,560 --> 00:11:45,510
♪ Letting moments overlap ♪

178
00:11:45,540 --> 00:11:47,830
♪ As we feel the world transform ♪

179
00:11:49,070 --> 00:11:52,470
♪ I'm just glad I was brave enough ♪

180
00:11:52,650 --> 00:11:55,510
♪ To meet the moon ♪

181
00:11:55,530 --> 00:11:58,460
♪ Gently, I pluck a piece of it ♪

182
00:11:58,490 --> 00:12:01,380
♪ And let loneliness fade away ♪

183
00:12:01,400 --> 00:12:05,560
♪ All I want is to be with you ♪

184
00:12:05,890 --> 00:12:08,760
♪ That's the only thing that matters ♪

185
00:12:08,870 --> 00:12:12,610
♪ Love gives us all ♪

186
00:12:12,630 --> 00:12:15,690
♪ Like the moon lighting up every night ♪

187
00:12:15,710 --> 00:12:16,530
♪ You know ♪

188
00:12:16,550 --> 00:12:19,790
♪ I want to fall in love with you ♪

189
00:12:19,810 --> 00:12:22,610
♪ No matter how many times I say
I love you ♪

190
00:12:22,640 --> 00:12:26,220
♪ Clouds, please drift a little closer ♪

191
00:12:27,120 --> 00:12:32,020
♪ I could say it ten thousand times
and never tire ♪

192
00:13:08,200 --> 00:13:08,990
Dear.

193
00:13:09,550 --> 00:13:12,080
Why are you picking a fight
with our daughter?

194
00:13:12,170 --> 00:13:14,170
How is this picking a fight with her?

195
00:13:15,120 --> 00:13:16,720
I'm just looking out for her.

196
00:13:16,740 --> 00:13:17,530
Yun Ye.

197
00:13:21,410 --> 00:13:22,810
Did she pick up the phone?

198
00:13:23,410 --> 00:13:24,050
No.

199
00:13:24,480 --> 00:13:25,240
Keep calling

200
00:13:25,240 --> 00:13:26,220
until she does.

201
00:13:29,010 --> 00:13:29,940
Do it right here!

202
00:13:30,670 --> 00:13:31,530
I'll watch you!

203
00:13:43,630 --> 00:13:44,480
She hung up.

204
00:14:00,960 --> 00:14:02,100
I already made it clear.

205
00:14:02,100 --> 00:14:03,580
Why are you calling me again?

206
00:14:03,580 --> 00:14:04,370
Hello, Li? Li,

207
00:14:04,370 --> 00:14:05,320
hurry and tell Dad.

208
00:14:05,320 --> 00:14:05,870
T-Tell him

209
00:14:05,870 --> 00:14:06,960
that we weren't in on this together.

210
00:14:06,960 --> 00:14:08,420
Hurry up a-and tell him...

211
00:14:10,720 --> 00:14:11,620
Where are you?

212
00:14:11,750 --> 00:14:13,370
You think you're all grown up now, huh?

213
00:14:13,370 --> 00:14:15,170
I just scolded you a little,
and now you're not coming home?

214
00:14:15,170 --> 00:14:16,230
I'm in Nanwu.

215
00:14:16,270 --> 00:14:17,800
What are you doing in Nanwu?

216
00:14:18,670 --> 00:14:20,410
I'm attending an event

217
00:14:21,290 --> 00:14:22,840
and getting to know the campus
while I'm there.

218
00:14:22,840 --> 00:14:24,320
I won't be coming back for now.

219
00:14:24,320 --> 00:14:25,120
And I'm going to look for

220
00:14:25,120 --> 00:14:26,820
an internship here afterward.

221
00:14:26,820 --> 00:14:27,680
No, you're not!

222
00:14:27,870 --> 00:14:29,660
Why did you have to go so far away?

223
00:14:29,660 --> 00:14:30,170
Come back

224
00:14:30,170 --> 00:14:31,240
and just stay at home.

225
00:14:31,240 --> 00:14:32,030
Either find yourself a job

226
00:14:32,030 --> 00:14:32,910
in Xifu

227
00:14:33,010 --> 00:14:33,980
or reapply for

228
00:14:33,980 --> 00:14:35,710
a local graduate program here.

229
00:14:37,670 --> 00:14:39,770
D-Don't be so bossy.

230
00:14:39,790 --> 00:14:42,120
At least listen to
what Li has to say first.

231
00:14:42,580 --> 00:14:44,110
Dad, you don't understand.

232
00:14:44,170 --> 00:14:45,740
NUST is a great university.

233
00:14:45,740 --> 00:14:46,170
Its automation program

234
00:14:46,170 --> 00:14:47,770
is one of the best in the country.

235
00:14:47,770 --> 00:14:48,670
Stop talking about that.

236
00:14:48,670 --> 00:14:50,320
Book a flight and come back right away.

237
00:14:50,320 --> 00:14:51,120
I won't!

238
00:14:54,080 --> 00:14:54,870
Lili,

239
00:14:55,700 --> 00:14:57,600
your dad is only saying this
because he cares about you.

240
00:14:57,600 --> 00:14:58,550
This is the first time

241
00:14:58,550 --> 00:15:01,120
you've gone somewhere so far away
by yourself.

242
00:15:01,120 --> 00:15:02,780
We're just worried about you.

243
00:15:03,010 --> 00:15:04,860
If you have any plans

244
00:15:04,860 --> 00:15:06,150
for your studies or career,

245
00:15:06,150 --> 00:15:08,080
just talk them through with Dad.

246
00:15:08,910 --> 00:15:10,640
There's nothing to talk about.

247
00:15:10,670 --> 00:15:11,860
Either come back now,

248
00:15:11,860 --> 00:15:13,250
or don't ever come back.

249
00:15:13,450 --> 00:15:15,840
Don't even think about
taking a single penny from us.

250
00:15:15,840 --> 00:15:17,480
Wait. I'm just doing my internship

251
00:15:17,480 --> 00:15:18,620
and looking for a job in another city.

252
00:15:18,620 --> 00:15:20,260
What's the problem with that?

253
00:15:20,260 --> 00:15:20,860
It's not like

254
00:15:20,860 --> 00:15:22,550
I'm never coming back.

255
00:15:22,860 --> 00:15:24,860
Every time I try to have
a proper conversation with you,

256
00:15:24,860 --> 00:15:26,960
when have you ever actually listened?

257
00:15:26,960 --> 00:15:28,270
I can't even finish a sentence

258
00:15:28,270 --> 00:15:29,120
before you shut me down.

259
00:15:29,120 --> 00:15:29,980
Other than disagreeing with me,

260
00:15:29,980 --> 00:15:31,380
what else do you ever say?

261
00:15:31,550 --> 00:15:32,360
Lili.

262
00:15:33,480 --> 00:15:34,250
Lili.

263
00:15:34,250 --> 00:15:35,850
Don't take it out on your dad.

264
00:15:36,250 --> 00:15:38,410
You know what he's like.

265
00:15:39,250 --> 00:15:42,050
He's harsh on the outside
but soft on the inside.

266
00:15:43,120 --> 00:15:44,980
Talk some sense into your sister.

267
00:15:45,410 --> 00:15:46,250
Li. Li,

268
00:15:46,270 --> 00:15:47,660
s-stop making things worse.

269
00:15:47,660 --> 00:15:48,370
Just come home,

270
00:15:48,370 --> 00:15:49,050
apologize to Dad,

271
00:15:49,050 --> 00:15:49,580
and back down a bit—

272
00:15:49,580 --> 00:15:51,240
then everything will be fine.

273
00:16:04,750 --> 00:16:07,080
Where would you get all that money,
Yun Li?

274
00:16:14,530 --> 00:16:16,290
Why did I have to act so tough?

275
00:17:00,390 --> 00:17:01,200
Shize.

276
00:17:02,480 --> 00:17:04,540
Why did I have to cross paths with you?

277
00:17:10,880 --> 00:17:11,680
Yuan...

278
00:18:03,900 --> 00:18:05,830
The money has been transferred to you.

279
00:18:05,830 --> 00:18:06,610
Cut the crap.

280
00:18:58,500 --> 00:18:59,170
Hello?

281
00:18:59,190 --> 00:19:00,080
Ms. Idle Cloud.

282
00:19:00,110 --> 00:19:01,180
We'll all gather

283
00:19:01,180 --> 00:19:01,850
in the lobby of the Experience Center

284
00:19:01,850 --> 00:19:03,310
at 3 p.m. this afternoon.

285
00:19:03,350 --> 00:19:04,250
The company has arranged

286
00:19:04,250 --> 00:19:06,110
a visit and hands-on experience session
for everyone.

287
00:19:06,110 --> 00:19:07,750
Please be sure to attend on time.

288
